    "Pathlight can monitor ordinary folders immediately. For protected macOS locations such as Mail, Safari, Messages, and Library content, grant Full Disk Access in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pathlight 可以直接监控普通文件夹。若要监控邮件、Safari、信息和资源库等受保护的位置，请在“系统设置”中授予完全磁盘访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pathlight records what changes inside the folders you monitor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
